{
 "file": "06BLK02D base 0x5000",
 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:10",
   "ptr": "0x10",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「お父様の病は、日を追うごとに悪くな\\n",
   "en": "\"Father's illness grows worse with each passing day. And no matter which doctor we bring to him, none of them can find the cause.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:39",
   "ptr": "0x39",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "  ってゆきます。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02D:10"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:4e",
   "ptr": "0x4e",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　しかも、どんなお医者様に見せても原\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  ってゆきます。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02D:10"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:77",
   "ptr": "0x77",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "  因がわからないと言うんです。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02D:10"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:9b",
   "ptr": "0x9b",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "　どうしたらいいんでしょう？\\n",
   "en": "What am I to do? If this goes on... Father will...\"",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:bc",
   "ptr": "0xbc",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　このままでは・・・お父様は・・・」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　どうしたらいいんでしょう？\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02D:9b"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:f0",
   "ptr": "0xf0",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "「お父様の病が、すっかり直ったんです！\\n",
   "en": "\"Father has made a full recovery! I hear it is all thanks to you. Thank you so very much.",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:11b",
   "ptr": "0x11b",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　すべて、あなた様のお力だと聞きまし\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02D:f0"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:144",
   "ptr": "0x144",
   "len": 8,
   "jp": "  た。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 8,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02D:f0"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:14f",
   "ptr": "0x14f",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "　ありがとうございます。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  た。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02D:f0"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:16d",
   "ptr": "0x16d",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　わたしが交際してる貴族の殿方は、\\n",
   "en": "The noble gentlemen I keep company with look down on those who wield swords, so until now I, too, thought warriors and mercenaries were lowly folk.",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:194",
   "ptr": "0x194",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  剣を振るう者を蔑んでおられるので、\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02D:16d"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:1bd",
   "ptr": "0x1bd",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "  わたしも今までは戦士や傭兵を、\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02D:16d"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:1e2",
   "ptr": "0x1e2",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "  卑しい者と思ってました。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02D:16d"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:202",
   "ptr": "0x202",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　でも、これからは考えを改めます。\\f",
   "en": "But from now on, I'll rethink that.",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:22a",
   "ptr": "0x22a",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　わたしたちに再び災いが降りかかった\\n",
   "en": "Should misfortune befall us again, please lend us your strength once more. I beg of you.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:253",
   "ptr": "0x253",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  時は、どうか、また、あなた様の力を\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02D:22a"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:27c",
   "ptr": "0x27c",
   "len": 20,
   "jp": "  お貸しください。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 20,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02D:22a"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:293",
   "ptr": "0x293",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "　お願いします」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  お貸しください。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02D:22a"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:2ab",
   "ptr": "0x2ab",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "「できることなら、いつまでも、\\n",
   "en": "\"If only you could stay and work for us forever...\"",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:2ce",
   "ptr": "0x2ce",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "  わたしたちのために働いてほしいの\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02D:2ab"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:2f5",
   "ptr": "0x2f5",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "  ですが・・・」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02D:2ab"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:31d",
   "ptr": "0x31d",
   "len": 10,
   "jp": "ゲンハス\\n",
   "en": "Genhas",
   "max": 10,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:32a",
   "ptr": "0x32a",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「お前か、わしに腕を貸してくれる男と\\n",
   "en": "\"So you're the man who's to lend me his sword arm, eh? Hmm, yes, you've a fine look about you.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "ゲンハス\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:353",
   "ptr": "0x353",
   "len": 14,
   "jp": "  いうのは。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 14,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02D:32a"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:364",
   "ptr": "0x364",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　なるほど、いい面構えをしておる。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  いうのは。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02D:32a"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:38c",
   "ptr": "0x38c",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "　実は、わしは・・・グッ！？\\n",
   "en": "The truth is, I... Ngh?! Gaaghaghaghaghagh! Gahh!",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:3ad",
   "ptr": "0x3ad",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "　ぐががががががが！　がふっ！\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　実は、わしは・・・グッ！？\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02D:38c"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:3d1",
   "ptr": "0x3d1",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　げほごほ、げほごほごほごほごほごほ\\n",
   "en": "Kaff koff, kaff koff koff koff koff koff koff koff koff! Kaff! Hooo... hooo... hoooooo.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:3fa",
   "ptr": "0x3fa",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "  ごほごほごほッ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02D:3d1"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:40f",
   "ptr": "0x40f",
   "len": 12,
   "jp": "　げほッ！\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 12,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  ごほごほごほッ\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02D:3d1"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:41e",
   "ptr": "0x41e",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "　ふう～ふ～ふうううう～。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　げほッ！\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02D:3d1"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:43e",
   "ptr": "0x43e",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　み、見ての通り、病に犯されておる。\\n",
   "en": "A-As you can see, I'm stricken with illness. Those quacks can't make head or tail of it, but I knooooow full well what the cause is!",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:467",
   "ptr": "0x467",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　ヤブ医者どもには解からんようだが、\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02D:43e"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:490",
   "ptr": "0x490",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  わしにはこの原因がよおおおおおお解\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02D:43e"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:4b9",
   "ptr": "0x4b9",
   "len": 8,
   "jp": "  る！\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 8,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02D:43e"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:4c5",
   "ptr": "0x4c5",
   "len": 12,
   "jp": "　呪いだ！\\n",
   "en": "It's a curse! Someone has put a curse on me!",
   "max": 12,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:4d4",
   "ptr": "0x4d4",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "　何者かがわしを呪っておるのだ！\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　呪いだ！\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02D:4c5"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:4fa",
   "ptr": "0x4fa",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　病人の妄想などではないぞ、呪いをか\\n",
   "en": "And this is no sick man's fancy, mind you! There's a feeling that only the cursed man himself can know.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:523",
   "ptr": "0x523",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  けられた当人にしか分からん感覚とい\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02D:4fa"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:54c",
   "ptr": "0x54c",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "  うものがあるんだからな。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02D:4fa"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:56c",
   "ptr": "0x56c",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "  わしの受けているこの感じからすると、\\n",
   "en": "From what I'm feeling, whoever's cursing me is close by. Somewhere in this very city, I'll wager!",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:597",
   "ptr": "0x597",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "  呪ってる者はすぐ近くにおる。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02D:56c"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:5ba",
   "ptr": "0x5ba",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "  おそらく、この街のどこかにおる！\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02D:56c"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:5e2",
   "ptr": "0x5e2",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　お前の仕事は、その者を見つけだし、\\n",
   "en": "Your job is to find him and cut him down! I'll pay you handsomely! Koff koff gahh! Koff! Hooo... hooo...\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:60b",
   "ptr": "0x60b",
   "len": 24,
   "jp": "  たたっ斬ることだ！　\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 24,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02D:5e2"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:626",
   "ptr": "0x626",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　報酬ははずむぞ！　ごほごほがほッ！\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  たたっ斬ることだ！　\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02D:5e2"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:64f",
   "ptr": "0x64f",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "　ごほッ！ふううう～ふうう～」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02D:5e2"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02D:675",
   "ptr": "0x675",
